{"message":"Net change during 2006 equals ending balance at Dec 31, 2006 ($134 million) less beginning balance at Dec 31, 2005 / Jan 1, 2006 ($116 million). 134 - 116 = 18 million. This also equals 2006 expensed 155 - cash payments 141 + foreign currency revaluation 4 = 18.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"134 - 116","sources":{"134":"source:t8c1n0","116":"source:t4c1n0"}}}